WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Rostering → Timesheets and choose the location and week.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.458
Step 2: Review actual start/end times and recorded unpaid breaks. Submit a manual entry with a reason if work is missing.

3
00:00:13.458 --> 00:00:21.542
Step 3: An authorised reviewer can approve, reject, reopen or correct an entry. Corrections require a reason and return it to pending approval.

4
00:00:21.542 --> 00:00:37.750
Step 4: Check rates and award warnings before approval. Pay details shows breaks first; expand Actual allowance details and reimbursements for worked kilometres, cold-work minutes, overtime meals or expenses, and enter only what actually applied. Approving eligible ordinary hours updates tracked annual-leave accrual. Use Export CSV for permitted entries.
